(
    '43030000-0000-4000-8100-000000000001'::uuid,
    'advanced-01-meeting-your-partner-s-parents', 'Meeting your partner''s parents', 'Win over your partner''s parents at dinner and dodge the wedding talk.',
    'advanced', 5, 1, false, 1,
    'advanced-v1', 'hold-your-own', 'Hold your own',
    1, 1, 3, 14,
    3.05, array['partner', 'family', 'culture']::text[], 'authored_roadmap', 'native_speaker_review_required',
    '{"title":"Meeting your partner''s parents","scenarioKey":"roadmap_advanced_01_hold_your_own","scenario":"Win over your partner''s parents at dinner and dodge the wedding talk.","minutes":5,"difficulty":3.05,"rounds":[{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_01_hold_your_own","situation":"You arrive for dinner at your partner''s family home. Their parents, Tito Ben and Tita Lorna, open the door.","tagalog":"Magandang gabi po, Tito, Tita. May dala po akong leche flan, sana magustuhan ninyo.","translation":"Good evening, Tito, Tita. I brought some leche flan; I hope you like it.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Magandang gabi po, Tito, Tita.","english":"good evening, Tito, Tita","note":"A partner''s parents are usually Tito and Tita, always with po."},{"tagalog":"May dala po akong leche flan,","english":"I brought some leche flan","note":"Never arrive empty-handed: ''may dala'' means you brought something along."},{"tagalog":"sana magustuhan ninyo.","english":"I hope you''ll like it","note":"Ninyo is the respectful ''you'' here, as the ones doing the liking."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Magandang","english":"good, beautiful (+ linker)"},{"token":"gabi","english":"evening, night"},{"token":"po,","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"Tito,","english":"uncle (Tito)"},{"token":"Tita.","english":"aunt (Tita)"},{"token":"May","english":"there is / have"},{"token":"dala","english":"brought along"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"akong","english":"I (+ linker)"},{"token":"leche flan,","english":"leche flan (caramel custard)"},{"token":"sana","english":"I hope"},{"token":"magustuhan","english":"like (future, will like)"},{"token":"ninyo.","english":"your / by you (respectful / plural)"}],"speakingPrompt":"Greet both parents respectfully and offer the dessert you brought."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_01_hold_your_own","situation":"Dinner is served, and Tita Lorna''s kare-kare is excellent. She watches you take the first bite.","tagalog":"Ang sarap po ng kare-kare ninyo, Tita! Kayo po ba mismo ang nagluto nito?","translation":"Your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita! Did you cook this yourself?","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Ang sarap po ng kare-kare ninyo, Tita!","english":"your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita!","note":"Ang + adjective is an exclamation: ''so tasty!''. Po sits right after the first word."},{"tagalog":"Kayo po ba mismo","english":"was it you yourself","note":"Mismo means ''yourself, in person''; ba turns it into a question."},{"tagalog":"ang nagluto nito?","english":"who cooked this?","note":"Nagluto = cooked (completed action)."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Ang sarap","english":"so delicious"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"ng","english":"of / a (marker)"},{"token":"kare-kare","english":"kare-kare (oxtail peanut stew)"},{"token":"ninyo,","english":"your / by you (respectful / plural)"},{"token":"Tita!","english":"aunt (Tita)"},{"token":"Kayo","english":"you (respectful / plural)"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"ba","english":"(question marker)"},{"token":"mismo","english":"yourself, in person"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"nagluto","english":"cooked (completed)"},{"token":"nito?","english":"this (of this)"}],"speakingPrompt":"Compliment her cooking warmly and ask whether she made it herself."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_01_hold_your_own","situation":"Tito Ben puts down his spoon and asks what you do for a living. This is your chance to sound serious.","tagalog":"Nagtatrabaho po ako sa isang BPO sa Makati, at nag-iipon na rin po kami para sa sariling bahay.","translation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Nagtatrabaho po ako","english":"I work","note":"Nagtatrabaho is the ongoing aspect: ''am working''."},{"tagalog":"sa isang BPO sa Makati,","english":"at a BPO in Makati","note":"BPO (outsourcing, call centres) stays in English, as in any Manila conversation."},{"tagalog":"at nag-iipon na rin po kami","english":"and we''re already saving up too","note":"Kami is ''we'' without the listener: you and your partner, not Tito."},{"tagalog":"para sa sariling bahay.","english":"for a house of our own","note":"Sarili + -ng = ''own''."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Nagtatrabaho","english":"working (ongoing)"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"ako","english":"I"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"isang","english":"one, a"},{"token":"BPO","english":"BPO (outsourcing company)"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"Makati,","english":"Makati"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"nag-iipon","english":"saving up (ongoing)"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"rin","english":"too, also"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"kami","english":"we (not including you)"},{"token":"para","english":"for / so that"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"sariling","english":"own (+ linker)"},{"token":"bahay.","english":"house, home"}],"speakingPrompt":"Tell him where you work and that the two of you are saving for a home.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Nagtatrabaho po ako sa isang BPO sa Makati, at nag-iipon na rin po kami para sa sariling bahay.","promptTranslation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"Oh, Tita, we''re already talking about it. But of course, we want to be truly ready first."},{"englishTranslation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own."},{"englishTranslation":"Bless me, Tito, Tita. Thank you for the wonderful dinner; next time I''ll do the cooking."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_01_hold_your_own","situation":"Tita Lorna leans in with a big smile and asks when the wedding is. The whole table goes quiet.","tagalog":"Naku, Tita, pinag-uusapan na po namin ''yan. Pero siyempre, gusto muna naming maging handa talaga.","translation":"Oh, Tita, we''re already talking about it. But of course, we want to be truly ready first.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Naku, Tita,","english":"oh my, Tita","note":"Naku buys you a second and keeps the mood light."},{"tagalog":"pinag-uusapan na po namin ''yan.","english":"we''re already talking about that","note":"Pinag-uusapan = being discussed (ongoing); namin = by us."},{"tagalog":"Pero siyempre,","english":"but of course","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"gusto muna naming maging handa talaga.","english":"we want to be really ready first","note":"Muna means ''first, for now'': the polite way to buy time."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Naku,","english":"oh my"},{"token":"Tita,","english":"aunt (Tita)"},{"token":"pinag-uusapan","english":"being talked about (ongoing)"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"namin","english":"by us / our (not including you)"},{"token":"''yan.","english":"that (short for iyan)"},{"token":"Pero","english":"but"},{"token":"siyempre,","english":"of course"},{"token":"gusto","english":"want, like"},{"token":"muna","english":"first, for now"},{"token":"naming","english":"we (+ linker, not including you)"},{"token":"maging","english":"to be, become"},{"token":"handa","english":"ready"},{"token":"talaga.","english":"really, truly"}],"speakingPrompt":"Laugh it off gently: say you''re discussing it, but want to be ready first."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_01_hold_your_own","situation":"The evening is over. As you leave, you take each parent''s hand for the traditional blessing.","tagalog":"Mano po, Tito, Tita. Salamat po sa napakasarap na hapunan. Next time, ako na po ang magluluto.","translation":"Bless me, Tito, Tita. Thank you for the wonderful dinner; next time I''ll do the cooking.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Mano po, Tito, Tita.","english":"your hand for a blessing, Tito, Tita","note":"Say it as you press their hand to your forehead: the mano."},{"tagalog":"Salamat po sa napakasarap na hapunan.","english":"thank you for the wonderful dinner","note":"Napaka- + adjective = ''very, so''."},{"tagalog":"Next time, ako na po ang magluluto.","english":"next time, I''ll be the one cooking","note":"Magluluto is the future aspect; ''ako na'' = ''let me take over''."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Mano po,","english":"your hand, please (asking for a blessing)"},{"token":"Tito,","english":"uncle (Tito)"},{"token":"Tita.","english":"aunt (Tita)"},{"token":"Salamat","english":"thank you"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"napakasarap","english":"very delicious"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"hapunan.","english":"dinner"},{"token":"Next time,","english":"next time"},{"token":"ako","english":"I"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"magluluto.","english":"will cook (future)"}],"speakingPrompt":"Ask for their blessing, thank them for dinner, and offer to cook next time.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Mano po, Tito, Tita. Salamat po sa napakasarap na hapunan. Next time, ako na po ang magluluto.","promptTranslation":"Bless me, Tito, Tita. Thank you for the wonderful dinner; next time I''ll do the cooking.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"Good evening, Tito, Tita. I brought some leche flan; I hope you like it."},{"englishTranslation":"Bless me, Tito, Tita. Thank you for the wonderful dinner; next time I''ll do the cooking."},{"englishTranslation":"Your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita! Did you cook this yourself?"}],"correctOptionIndex":1}}],"vocabulary":[{"tagalog":"Magandang gabi po, Tito, Tita","english":"good evening, Tito, Tita","example":"Magandang gabi po, Tito, Tita. May dala po akong leche flan, sana magustuhan ninyo.","exampleTranslation":"Good evening, Tito, Tita. I brought some leche flan; I hope you like it."},{"tagalog":"May dala po akong leche flan","english":"I brought some leche flan","example":"Magandang gabi po, Tito, Tita. May dala po akong leche flan, sana magustuhan ninyo.","exampleTranslation":"Good evening, Tito, Tita. I brought some leche flan; I hope you like it."},{"tagalog":"sana magustuhan ninyo","english":"I hope you''ll like it","example":"Magandang gabi po, Tito, Tita. May dala po akong leche flan, sana magustuhan ninyo.","exampleTranslation":"Good evening, Tito, Tita. I brought some leche flan; I hope you like it."},{"tagalog":"Ang sarap po ng kare-kare ninyo, Tita","english":"your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita!","example":"Ang sarap po ng kare-kare ninyo, Tita! Kayo po ba mismo ang nagluto nito?","exampleTranslation":"Your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita! Did you cook this yourself?"},{"tagalog":"Kayo po ba mismo","english":"was it you yourself","example":"Ang sarap po ng kare-kare ninyo, Tita! Kayo po ba mismo ang nagluto nito?","exampleTranslation":"Your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita! Did you cook this yourself?"},{"tagalog":"ang nagluto nito","english":"who cooked this?","example":"Ang sarap po ng kare-kare ninyo, Tita! Kayo po ba mismo ang nagluto nito?","exampleTranslation":"Your kare-kare is so delicious, Tita! Did you cook this yourself?"},{"tagalog":"Nagtatrabaho po ako","english":"I work","example":"Nagtatrabaho po ako sa isang BPO sa Makati, at nag-iipon na rin po kami para sa sariling bahay.","exampleTranslation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own."},{"tagalog":"sa isang BPO sa Makati","english":"at a BPO in Makati","example":"Nagtatrabaho po ako sa isang BPO sa Makati, at nag-iipon na rin po kami para sa sariling bahay.","exampleTranslation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own."},{"tagalog":"at nag-iipon na rin po kami","english":"and we''re already saving up too","example":"Nagtatrabaho po ako sa isang BPO sa Makati, at nag-iipon na rin po kami para sa sariling bahay.","exampleTranslation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own."},{"tagalog":"para sa sariling bahay","english":"for a house of our own","example":"Nagtatrabaho po ako sa isang BPO sa Makati, at nag-iipon na rin po kami para sa sariling bahay.","exampleTranslation":"I work at a BPO in Makati, and we''re already saving up for a house of our own."}]}'::jsonb, 'c3fed7516aa6590dc24d4feb89449bff560b7d75cd87a7ea1b6b7ef771e63a85', '{"contract":"kumusta_lesson_v3","structured_output":true,"local_validation":true,"ordered_chunks":true,"vocabulary_grounded":true,"vocabulary_examples_grounded":true,"hear_respond_rounds":[2,4],"authored_curriculum":true,"native_speaker_review":false}'::jsonb
  ),
(
    '43030000-0000-4000-8100-000000000002'::uuid,
    'advanced-02-chismis-with-your-best-friend', 'Chismis with your best friend', 'Share family gossip with your best friend and swear them to secrecy.',
    'advanced', 5, 2, false, 1,
    'advanced-v1', 'hold-your-own', 'Hold your own',
    1, 2, 3, 14,
    3.10, array['family', 'culture']::text[], 'authored_roadmap', 'native_speaker_review_required',
    '{"title":"Chismis with your best friend","scenarioKey":"roadmap_advanced_02_hold_your_own","scenario":"Share family gossip with your best friend and swear them to secrecy.","minutes":5,"difficulty":3.1,"rounds":[{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_02_hold_your_own","situation":"You''re having merienda with your best friend at a cafe. You can''t hold the news in any longer.","tagalog":"Bes, may chika ako sa''yo, pero promise, sa ating dalawa lang ''to, ha?","translation":"Bestie, I''ve got some gossip for you, but promise this stays between the two of us, okay?","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Bes, may chika ako sa''yo,","english":"bestie, I''ve got some news for you","note":"Bes (from bestie) works for any close friend; chika = gossip, the latest."},{"tagalog":"pero promise,","english":"but promise","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"sa ating dalawa lang ''to, ha?","english":"this stays between the two of us, okay?","note":"Ha? at the end asks for agreement, like ''okay?''."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Bes,","english":"bestie"},{"token":"may","english":"there is / have"},{"token":"chika","english":"gossip, news"},{"token":"ako","english":"I"},{"token":"sa''yo,","english":"to you (short for sa iyo)"},{"token":"pero","english":"but"},{"token":"promise,","english":"promise"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"ating","english":"our (including you)"},{"token":"dalawa","english":"two"},{"token":"lang","english":"only, just"},{"token":"''to,","english":"this (short for ito)"},{"token":"ha?","english":"okay? (seeking agreement)"}],"speakingPrompt":"Tell your friend you have juicy news, and make them promise to keep it secret."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_02_hold_your_own","situation":"Your friend leans in. Spill it: your cousin Mark has secretly proposed to his girlfriend Liza.","tagalog":"''Yung pinsan kong si Mark, nag-propose na raw kay Liza, pero hindi pa alam ni Tita Baby!","translation":"Apparently my cousin Mark proposed to Liza, but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!","chunks":[{"tagalog":"''Yung pinsan kong si Mark,","english":"my cousin Mark","note":"Opening with ''yung + the person sets up the story, very conversational."},{"tagalog":"nag-propose na raw kay Liza,","english":"apparently already proposed to Liza","note":"Raw (daw after consonants) = ''reportedly'': the essential gossip word."},{"tagalog":"pero hindi pa alam ni Tita Baby!","english":"but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!","note":"Hindi pa = not yet."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"''Yung","english":"the, that (short for iyong)"},{"token":"pinsan","english":"cousin"},{"token":"kong","english":"my / I (+ linker)"},{"token":"si","english":"(name marker)"},{"token":"Mark,","english":"Mark"},{"token":"nag-propose","english":"proposed (completed)"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"raw","english":"reportedly, apparently"},{"token":"kay","english":"to (a person)"},{"token":"Liza,","english":"Liza"},{"token":"pero","english":"but"},{"token":"hindi","english":"not"},{"token":"pa","english":"still / yet / more"},{"token":"alam","english":"know / known"},{"token":"ni","english":"of / by (name marker)"},{"token":"Tita","english":"aunt (Tita)"},{"token":"Baby!","english":"Baby (a nickname)"}],"speakingPrompt":"Share the news you heard about your cousin, and that his mum hasn''t been told."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_02_hold_your_own","situation":"Your friend asks how you could possibly know that. Explain what you spotted online.","tagalog":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing sa IG story niya, tapos dinelete niya agad after five minutes.","translation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing","english":"because I saw the ring","note":"Kasi (''because'') often comes right after the first words in casual talk."},{"tagalog":"sa IG story niya,","english":"on her IG story","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"tapos dinelete niya agad","english":"then she deleted it right away","note":"Dinelete: an English verb with the Tagalog -in- infix for a completed action."},{"tagalog":"after five minutes.","english":"after five minutes","note":"Manila speakers often switch to English for small numbers and times like this."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Nakita","english":"saw (completed)"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"kasi","english":"because"},{"token":"''yung","english":"the, that (short for iyong)"},{"token":"singsing","english":"ring"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"IG story","english":"Instagram story"},{"token":"niya,","english":"his, her / by him, her"},{"token":"tapos","english":"then, after that"},{"token":"dinelete","english":"deleted (completed)"},{"token":"niya","english":"his, her / by him, her"},{"token":"agad","english":"right away"},{"token":"after","english":"after"},{"token":"five","english":"five"},{"token":"minutes.","english":"minutes"}],"speakingPrompt":"Explain that you saw the ring on social media before it was quickly deleted.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing sa IG story niya, tapos dinelete niya agad after five minutes.","promptTranslation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"Don''t spread it around, okay? If Tita finds out it came from me, I''m dead."},{"englishTranslation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes."},{"englishTranslation":"Hey, I''m not a gossip! I''m just a concerned citizen, and you''re the only one I''ve told."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_02_hold_your_own","situation":"Your friend''s eyes light up. Remind them how much trouble you''d be in if this got out.","tagalog":"Huwag mong ikakalat, ha? Pag nalaman ni Tita na sa akin galing, patay ako.","translation":"Don''t spread it around, okay? If Tita finds out it came from me, I''m dead.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Huwag mong ikakalat, ha?","english":"don''t you spread it around, okay?","note":"Huwag + mo + -ng + verb = ''don''t you ...''."},{"tagalog":"Pag nalaman ni Tita","english":"if Tita finds out","note":"Pag (short for kapag) = ''if, when''; nalaman = found out."},{"tagalog":"na sa akin galing,","english":"that it came from me","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"patay ako.","english":"I''m dead","note":"Playful exaggeration, exactly like the English."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Huwag","english":"don''t"},{"token":"mong","english":"you / your (+ linker)"},{"token":"ikakalat,","english":"spread around (future)"},{"token":"ha?","english":"okay? (seeking agreement)"},{"token":"Pag","english":"if, when (short for kapag)"},{"token":"nalaman","english":"found out (completed)"},{"token":"ni","english":"of / by (name marker)"},{"token":"Tita","english":"aunt (Tita)"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"akin","english":"me"},{"token":"galing,","english":"came from"},{"token":"patay","english":"dead (as in ''I''m dead'')"},{"token":"ako.","english":"I"}],"speakingPrompt":"Warn your friend not to spread it, and say what happens if your aunt traces it to you."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_02_hold_your_own","situation":"Your friend laughs and calls you the family gossip. Defend yourself, jokingly.","tagalog":"Hoy, hindi ako Marites, ha! Concerned citizen lang ako, at ikaw lang naman ang sinabihan ko.","translation":"Hey, I''m not a gossip! I''m just a concerned citizen, and you''re the only one I''ve told.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Hoy, hindi ako Marites, ha!","english":"hey, I''m not a gossip, okay!","note":"Marites (from ''Mare, ano''ng latest?'') is the playful nickname for a gossip."},{"tagalog":"Concerned citizen lang ako,","english":"I''m just a concerned citizen","note":"A classic tongue-in-cheek Taglish defence."},{"tagalog":"at ikaw lang naman ang sinabihan ko.","english":"and you''re the only one I told anyway","note":"Naman softens it: ''it''s only you, after all''."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Hoy,","english":"hey"},{"token":"hindi","english":"not"},{"token":"ako","english":"I"},{"token":"Marites,","english":"gossip (playful nickname)"},{"token":"ha!","english":"okay? (seeking agreement)"},{"token":"Concerned citizen","english":"concerned citizen"},{"token":"lang","english":"only, just"},{"token":"ako,","english":"I"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"ikaw","english":"you (emphatic)"},{"token":"lang","english":"only, just"},{"token":"naman","english":"(softener) after all"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"sinabihan","english":"told (completed)"},{"token":"ko.","english":"I / my"}],"speakingPrompt":"Deny being a gossip, joke about being a concerned citizen, and say only they know.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Hoy, hindi ako Marites, ha! Concerned citizen lang ako, at ikaw lang naman ang sinabihan ko.","promptTranslation":"Hey, I''m not a gossip! I''m just a concerned citizen, and you''re the only one I''ve told.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"Bestie, I''ve got some gossip for you, but promise this stays between the two of us, okay?"},{"englishTranslation":"Hey, I''m not a gossip! I''m just a concerned citizen, and you''re the only one I''ve told."},{"englishTranslation":"Apparently my cousin Mark proposed to Liza, but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!"}],"correctOptionIndex":1}}],"vocabulary":[{"tagalog":"Bes, may chika ako sa''yo","english":"bestie, I''ve got some news for you","example":"Bes, may chika ako sa''yo, pero promise, sa ating dalawa lang ''to, ha?","exampleTranslation":"Bestie, I''ve got some gossip for you, but promise this stays between the two of us, okay?"},{"tagalog":"pero promise","english":"but promise","example":"Bes, may chika ako sa''yo, pero promise, sa ating dalawa lang ''to, ha?","exampleTranslation":"Bestie, I''ve got some gossip for you, but promise this stays between the two of us, okay?"},{"tagalog":"sa ating dalawa lang ''to, ha","english":"this stays between the two of us, okay?","example":"Bes, may chika ako sa''yo, pero promise, sa ating dalawa lang ''to, ha?","exampleTranslation":"Bestie, I''ve got some gossip for you, but promise this stays between the two of us, okay?"},{"tagalog":"''Yung pinsan kong si Mark","english":"my cousin Mark","example":"''Yung pinsan kong si Mark, nag-propose na raw kay Liza, pero hindi pa alam ni Tita Baby!","exampleTranslation":"Apparently my cousin Mark proposed to Liza, but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!"},{"tagalog":"nag-propose na raw kay Liza","english":"apparently already proposed to Liza","example":"''Yung pinsan kong si Mark, nag-propose na raw kay Liza, pero hindi pa alam ni Tita Baby!","exampleTranslation":"Apparently my cousin Mark proposed to Liza, but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!"},{"tagalog":"pero hindi pa alam ni Tita Baby","english":"but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!","example":"''Yung pinsan kong si Mark, nag-propose na raw kay Liza, pero hindi pa alam ni Tita Baby!","exampleTranslation":"Apparently my cousin Mark proposed to Liza, but Tita Baby doesn''t know yet!"},{"tagalog":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing","english":"because I saw the ring","example":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing sa IG story niya, tapos dinelete niya agad after five minutes.","exampleTranslation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes."},{"tagalog":"sa IG story niya","english":"on her IG story","example":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing sa IG story niya, tapos dinelete niya agad after five minutes.","exampleTranslation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes."},{"tagalog":"tapos dinelete niya agad","english":"then she deleted it right away","example":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing sa IG story niya, tapos dinelete niya agad after five minutes.","exampleTranslation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes."},{"tagalog":"after five minutes","english":"after five minutes","example":"Nakita ko kasi ''yung singsing sa IG story niya, tapos dinelete niya agad after five minutes.","exampleTranslation":"I saw the ring on her IG story, and then she deleted it right away after five minutes."}]}'::jsonb, 'e0a40999eb09e190152c4e58b20e1c2ade1a49b751734f50666e3e8283142a10', '{"contract":"kumusta_lesson_v3","structured_output":true,"local_validation":true,"ordered_chunks":true,"vocabulary_grounded":true,"vocabulary_examples_grounded":true,"hear_respond_rounds":[2,4],"authored_curriculum":true,"native_speaker_review":false}'::jsonb
