(
    '43030000-0000-4000-8100-000000000003'::uuid,
    'advanced-03-the-big-debate-working-abroad-or-staying-home', 'The big debate: working abroad or staying home', 'Disagree respectfully with Tito about working abroad or staying home.',
    'advanced', 5, 3, false, 1,
    'advanced-v1', 'hold-your-own', 'Hold your own',
    1, 3, 3, 14,
    3.15, array['family', 'work', 'lifeInThePhilippines']::text[], 'authored_roadmap', 'native_speaker_review_required',
    '{"title":"The big debate: working abroad or staying home","scenarioKey":"roadmap_advanced_03_hold_your_own","scenario":"Disagree respectfully with Tito about working abroad or staying home.","minutes":5,"difficulty":3.15,"rounds":[{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_03_hold_your_own","situation":"At a family lunch, Tito Ramon, a former OFW, insists every young person should work overseas.","tagalog":"Naiintindihan ko po ang punto ninyo, Tito, mas malaki talaga ang sweldo sa abroad.","translation":"I understand your point, Tito; the pay abroad really is much bigger.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Naiintindihan ko po","english":"I understand","note":"Agreeing first is the polite way into a disagreement with an elder."},{"tagalog":"ang punto ninyo, Tito,","english":"your point, Tito","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"mas malaki talaga ang sweldo sa abroad.","english":"the salary abroad really is bigger","note":"''Sa abroad'' is everyday Taglish for working overseas."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Naiintindihan","english":"understand (ongoing)"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"punto","english":"point"},{"token":"ninyo,","english":"your / by you (respectful / plural)"},{"token":"Tito,","english":"uncle (Tito)"},{"token":"mas","english":"more"},{"token":"malaki","english":"big"},{"token":"talaga","english":"really, truly"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"sweldo","english":"salary"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"abroad.","english":"abroad, overseas"}],"speakingPrompt":"Open by showing him you understand his point about the salary."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_03_hold_your_own","situation":"Tito Ramon nods, waiting for your ''but''. Gently bring in the other side.","tagalog":"Pero sa tingin ko po, hindi lahat ng bagay nababayaran ng pera, lalo na ''yung oras kasama ang pamilya.","translation":"But in my view, not everything can be paid for with money, especially time with family.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Pero sa tingin ko po,","english":"but in my opinion","note":"Sa tingin ko (''the way I see it'') is much softer than a flat no."},{"tagalog":"hindi lahat ng bagay nababayaran ng pera,","english":"not everything can be paid for with money","note":"Nababayaran = can be paid for (abilitative)."},{"tagalog":"lalo na ''yung oras kasama ang pamilya.","english":"especially time spent with family","note":"Use this ending to complete the spoken thought naturally."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Pero","english":"but"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"tingin","english":"view, opinion"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"po,","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"hindi","english":"not"},{"token":"lahat","english":"all, everyone, everything"},{"token":"ng","english":"of / a (marker)"},{"token":"bagay","english":"thing"},{"token":"nababayaran","english":"can be paid for"},{"token":"ng","english":"of / a (marker)"},{"token":"pera,","english":"money"},{"token":"lalo","english":"especially"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"''yung","english":"the, that (short for iyong)"},{"token":"oras","english":"time, hour"},{"token":"kasama","english":"with, together with"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"pamilya.","english":"family"}],"speakingPrompt":"Respectfully say that money can''t buy everything, especially family time."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_03_hold_your_own","situation":"Tito Ramon reminds you he spent twelve years in Dubai so his children could study.","tagalog":"Alam ko pong malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo, kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko.","translation":"I know you sacrificed a lot, and that''s why my cousins were able to finish school.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Alam ko pong","english":"I know (respectfully)","note":"Po + the linker -ng becomes ''pong'' before the next clause."},{"tagalog":"malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo,","english":"you sacrificed a great deal","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko.","english":"that''s why my cousins managed to graduate","note":"Nakapag- = managed to; kaya = so, that''s why."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Alam","english":"know / known"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"pong","english":"(respect marker) + that"},{"token":"malaki","english":"big"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"naisakripisyo","english":"sacrificed (completed)"},{"token":"ninyo,","english":"your / by you (respectful / plural)"},{"token":"kaya","english":"so, that''s why"},{"token":"nakapagtapos","english":"managed to graduate (completed)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"mga","english":"(plural marker) / about"},{"token":"pinsan","english":"cousin"},{"token":"ko.","english":"I / my"}],"speakingPrompt":"Honour his sacrifice and acknowledge what it made possible for your cousins.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Alam ko pong malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo, kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko.","promptTranslation":"I know you sacrificed a lot, and that''s why my cousins were able to finish school.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"But if there''s decent work here, I''d rather stay and help our own country."},{"englishTranslation":"I know you sacrificed a lot, and that''s why my cousins were able to finish school."},{"englishTranslation":"Maybe we''re both right; it really just depends on each family''s situation."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_03_hold_your_own","situation":"He asks you straight out what you would do in his shoes. State your own position.","tagalog":"Pero kung may maayos na trabaho naman dito, mas gusto ko pong manatili at tumulong sa sarili nating bayan.","translation":"But if there''s decent work here, I''d rather stay and help our own country.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Pero kung may maayos na trabaho naman dito,","english":"but if there''s decent work here anyway","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"mas gusto ko pong manatili","english":"I''d prefer to stay","note":"Mas gusto = prefer; manatili is a slightly formal ''remain'', good for a serious point."},{"tagalog":"at tumulong sa sarili nating bayan.","english":"and help our own country","note":"Natin includes Tito: it''s his country too."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Pero","english":"but"},{"token":"kung","english":"if / how / where"},{"token":"may","english":"there is / have"},{"token":"maayos","english":"decent, proper"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"trabaho","english":"work, job"},{"token":"naman","english":"(softener) after all"},{"token":"dito,","english":"here"},{"token":"mas","english":"more"},{"token":"gusto","english":"want, like"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"pong","english":"(respect marker) + that"},{"token":"manatili","english":"to stay, remain"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"tumulong","english":"to help"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"sarili","english":"own"},{"token":"nating","english":"our (+ linker, including you)"},{"token":"bayan.","english":"country, hometown"}],"speakingPrompt":"Say that, given decent work at home, you''d prefer to stay and help the country."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_03_hold_your_own","situation":"The debate is getting warm and Tita is giving you both a look. Close it gracefully.","tagalog":"Siguro po, pareho tayong tama, depende lang talaga sa sitwasyon ng bawat pamilya.","translation":"Maybe we''re both right; it really just depends on each family''s situation.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Siguro po,","english":"maybe","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"pareho tayong tama,","english":"we''re both right","note":"Tayo includes the listener: a gracious way to end a debate."},{"tagalog":"depende lang talaga sa sitwasyon ng bawat pamilya.","english":"it really just depends on each family''s situation","note":"Use this ending to complete the spoken thought naturally."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Siguro","english":"maybe"},{"token":"po,","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"pareho","english":"both, the same"},{"token":"tayong","english":"we (+ linker, including you)"},{"token":"tama,","english":"right, correct"},{"token":"depende","english":"depends"},{"token":"lang","english":"only, just"},{"token":"talaga","english":"really, truly"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"sitwasyon","english":"situation"},{"token":"ng","english":"of / a (marker)"},{"token":"bawat","english":"each, every"},{"token":"pamilya.","english":"family"}],"speakingPrompt":"Suggest you''re both right and that it depends on each family.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Siguro po, pareho tayong tama, depende lang talaga sa sitwasyon ng bawat pamilya.","promptTranslation":"Maybe we''re both right; it really just depends on each family''s situation.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"I understand your point, Tito; the pay abroad really is much bigger."},{"englishTranslation":"Maybe we''re both right; it really just depends on each family''s situation."},{"englishTranslation":"But in my view, not everything can be paid for with money, especially time with family."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}}],"vocabulary":[{"tagalog":"Naiintindihan ko po","english":"I understand","example":"Naiintindihan ko po ang punto ninyo, Tito, mas malaki talaga ang sweldo sa abroad.","exampleTranslation":"I understand your point, Tito; the pay abroad really is much bigger."},{"tagalog":"ang punto ninyo, Tito","english":"your point, Tito","example":"Naiintindihan ko po ang punto ninyo, Tito, mas malaki talaga ang sweldo sa abroad.","exampleTranslation":"I understand your point, Tito; the pay abroad really is much bigger."},{"tagalog":"mas malaki talaga ang sweldo sa abroad","english":"the salary abroad really is bigger","example":"Naiintindihan ko po ang punto ninyo, Tito, mas malaki talaga ang sweldo sa abroad.","exampleTranslation":"I understand your point, Tito; the pay abroad really is much bigger."},{"tagalog":"Pero sa tingin ko po","english":"but in my opinion","example":"Pero sa tingin ko po, hindi lahat ng bagay nababayaran ng pera, lalo na ''yung oras kasama ang pamilya.","exampleTranslation":"But in my view, not everything can be paid for with money, especially time with family."},{"tagalog":"hindi lahat ng bagay nababayaran ng pera","english":"not everything can be paid for with money","example":"Pero sa tingin ko po, hindi lahat ng bagay nababayaran ng pera, lalo na ''yung oras kasama ang pamilya.","exampleTranslation":"But in my view, not everything can be paid for with money, especially time with family."},{"tagalog":"lalo na ''yung oras kasama ang pamilya","english":"especially time spent with family","example":"Pero sa tingin ko po, hindi lahat ng bagay nababayaran ng pera, lalo na ''yung oras kasama ang pamilya.","exampleTranslation":"But in my view, not everything can be paid for with money, especially time with family."},{"tagalog":"Alam ko pong","english":"I know (respectfully)","example":"Alam ko pong malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo, kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko.","exampleTranslation":"I know you sacrificed a lot, and that''s why my cousins were able to finish school."},{"tagalog":"malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo","english":"you sacrificed a great deal","example":"Alam ko pong malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo, kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko.","exampleTranslation":"I know you sacrificed a lot, and that''s why my cousins were able to finish school."},{"tagalog":"kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko","english":"that''s why my cousins managed to graduate","example":"Alam ko pong malaki ang naisakripisyo ninyo, kaya nakapagtapos ang mga pinsan ko.","exampleTranslation":"I know you sacrificed a lot, and that''s why my cousins were able to finish school."},{"tagalog":"Pero kung may maayos na trabaho naman dito","english":"but if there''s decent work here anyway","example":"Pero kung may maayos na trabaho naman dito, mas gusto ko pong manatili at tumulong sa sarili nating bayan.","exampleTranslation":"But if there''s decent work here, I''d rather stay and help our own country."}]}'::jsonb, 'c2116d34ccfc0302e828d87f8133c9a4736c8f2c899edcf0a4b8a98a199de203', '{"contract":"kumusta_lesson_v3","structured_output":true,"local_validation":true,"ordered_chunks":true,"vocabulary_grounded":true,"vocabulary_examples_grounded":true,"hear_respond_rounds":[2,4],"authored_curriculum":true,"native_speaker_review":false}'::jsonb
