    '{"title":"Lolo''s story, in his own words","scenarioKey":"roadmap_advanced_09_lifes_big_moments","scenario":"Play Lolo telling how he left the Philippines to work abroad.","minutes":5,"difficulty":3.45,"rounds":[{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_09_lifes_big_moments","situation":"Role-play: you are Lolo. Your grandchild sits beside you on the porch and asks how you ended up abroad.","tagalog":"Apo, noong 1978, umalis ako sa Batangas para magtrabaho bilang construction worker sa Saudi.","translation":"My grandchild, in 1978 I left Batangas to work as a construction worker in Saudi.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Apo, noong 1978,","english":"grandchild, back in 1978","note":"Apo = grandchild; noong marks a time in the past."},{"tagalog":"umalis ako sa Batangas","english":"I left Batangas","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"para magtrabaho bilang construction worker sa Saudi.","english":"to work as a construction worker in Saudi","note":"Saudi Arabia was the classic first destination for OFWs of that era."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Apo,","english":"grandchild"},{"token":"noong","english":"back in, when (past)"},{"token":"1978,","english":"1978"},{"token":"umalis","english":"left (completed)"},{"token":"ako","english":"I"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"Batangas","english":"Batangas"},{"token":"para","english":"for / so that"},{"token":"magtrabaho","english":"to work"},{"token":"bilang","english":"as"},{"token":"construction","english":"construction"},{"token":"worker","english":"worker"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"Saudi.","english":"Saudi Arabia"}],"speakingPrompt":"Speaking as Lolo, tell your grandchild the year you left your province and what work you went to do."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_09_lifes_big_moments","situation":"Still as Lolo, remember the day you said goodbye to your wife and young son at the airport.","tagalog":"Iyak nang iyak ang lola mo sa airport, at ang tatay mo, apat na taon pa lang noon.","translation":"Your grandmother cried and cried at the airport, and your father was only four back then.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Iyak nang iyak ang lola mo sa airport,","english":"your grandma kept crying at the airport","note":"Verb + nang + verb = doing it over and over."},{"tagalog":"at ang tatay mo,","english":"and your father","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"apat na taon pa lang noon.","english":"was only four years old then","note":"Pa lang = ''only, just'': it stresses how young he was."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Iyak","english":"cry"},{"token":"nang","english":"(adverb marker) / for"},{"token":"iyak","english":"cry"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"lola","english":"grandma (Lola)"},{"token":"mo","english":"you / your (casual)"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"airport,","english":"airport"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"tatay","english":"father, dad"},{"token":"mo,","english":"you / your (casual)"},{"token":"apat","english":"four"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"taon","english":"years"},{"token":"pa lang","english":"only, just"},{"token":"noon.","english":"back then"}],"speakingPrompt":"As Lolo, describe how Lola cried at the airport and how young the grandchild''s father was."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_09_lifes_big_moments","situation":"As Lolo, tell your grandchild what life in the desert camp was really like.","tagalog":"Mahirap ang buhay doon. Sobrang init, at mga sulat lang ng lola mo ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","translation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Mahirap ang buhay doon.","english":"life there was hard","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"Sobrang init,","english":"it was extremely hot","note":"Sobra(ng) = too much, extremely."},{"tagalog":"at mga sulat lang ng lola mo","english":"and only your grandma''s letters","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","english":"were what kept my courage up","note":"Lakas ng loob = inner strength, courage."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Mahirap","english":"hard, difficult"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"buhay","english":"life"},{"token":"doon.","english":"there"},{"token":"Sobrang","english":"extremely, too"},{"token":"init,","english":"heat"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"mga","english":"(plural marker) / about"},{"token":"sulat","english":"letters"},{"token":"lang","english":"only, just"},{"token":"ng","english":"of / a (marker)"},{"token":"lola","english":"grandma (Lola)"},{"token":"mo","english":"you / your (casual)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"nagpapalakas","english":"strengthening (ongoing)"},{"token":"ng","english":"of / a (marker)"},{"token":"loob","english":"inner self, spirit"},{"token":"ko.","english":"I / my"}],"speakingPrompt":"Speaking as Lolo, describe the heat and the letters that kept you going.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Mahirap ang buhay doon. Sobrang init, at mga sulat lang ng lola mo ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","promptTranslation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"I endured all of it because I wanted my children to go to school and not struggle like I did."},{"englishTranslation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up."},{"englishTranslation":"So you, my grandchild, never forget where you came from, wherever you end up."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_09_lifes_big_moments","situation":"Your grandchild asks why you didn''t just come home. As Lolo, explain what kept you there.","tagalog":"Tiniis ko ang lahat, kasi gusto kong makapag-aral ang mga anak ko at hindi sila maghirap tulad ko.","translation":"I endured all of it because I wanted my children to go to school and not struggle like I did.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Tiniis ko ang lahat,","english":"I endured everything","note":"Tiisin = to endure; tiniis = endured. A core word in OFW stories."},{"tagalog":"kasi gusto kong makapag-aral ang mga anak ko","english":"because I wanted my children to be able to study","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"at hindi sila maghirap tulad ko.","english":"and not to struggle like me","note":"Use this ending to complete the spoken thought naturally."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Tiniis","english":"endured (completed)"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"lahat,","english":"all, everyone, everything"},{"token":"kasi","english":"because"},{"token":"gusto","english":"want, like"},{"token":"kong","english":"my / I (+ linker)"},{"token":"makapag-aral","english":"to be able to study"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"mga","english":"(plural marker) / about"},{"token":"anak","english":"children"},{"token":"ko","english":"I / my"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"hindi","english":"not"},{"token":"sila","english":"they"},{"token":"maghirap","english":"to struggle, suffer hardship"},{"token":"tulad","english":"like"},{"token":"ko.","english":"I / my"}],"speakingPrompt":"As Lolo, explain that you endured it all so your children could study and have it easier."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_09_lifes_big_moments","situation":"As Lolo, end the story by squeezing your grandchild''s hand and leaving them with some advice.","tagalog":"Kaya ikaw, apo, huwag mong kalilimutan kung saan ka nanggaling, saan ka man makarating.","translation":"So you, my grandchild, never forget where you came from, wherever you end up.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Kaya ikaw, apo,","english":"so you, my grandchild","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"huwag mong kalilimutan","english":"don''t ever forget","note":"Kalilimutan (future form) after huwag = ''don''t ever forget''."},{"tagalog":"kung saan ka nanggaling,","english":"where you came from","note":"Echoes the proverb about never forgetting where you came from."},{"tagalog":"saan ka man makarating.","english":"wherever you may end up","note":"Saan ... man = ''wherever''."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Kaya","english":"so, that''s why"},{"token":"ikaw,","english":"you (emphatic)"},{"token":"apo,","english":"grandchild"},{"token":"huwag","english":"don''t"},{"token":"mong","english":"you / your (+ linker)"},{"token":"kalilimutan","english":"will forget (future)"},{"token":"kung","english":"if / how / where"},{"token":"saan","english":"where"},{"token":"ka","english":"you (casual)"},{"token":"nanggaling,","english":"came from (completed)"},{"token":"saan","english":"where"},{"token":"ka","english":"you (casual)"},{"token":"man","english":"(-ever)"},{"token":"makarating.","english":"to get there, arrive"}],"speakingPrompt":"Speaking as Lolo, urge your grandchild never to forget their roots, wherever life takes them.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Kaya ikaw, apo, huwag mong kalilimutan kung saan ka nanggaling, saan ka man makarating.","promptTranslation":"So you, my grandchild, never forget where you came from, wherever you end up.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"My grandchild, in 1978 I left Batangas to work as a construction worker in Saudi."},{"englishTranslation":"So you, my grandchild, never forget where you came from, wherever you end up."},{"englishTranslation":"Your grandmother cried and cried at the airport, and your father was only four back then."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}}],"vocabulary":[{"tagalog":"Apo, noong 1978","english":"grandchild, back in 1978","example":"Apo, noong 1978, umalis ako sa Batangas para magtrabaho bilang construction worker sa Saudi.","exampleTranslation":"My grandchild, in 1978 I left Batangas to work as a construction worker in Saudi."},{"tagalog":"umalis ako sa Batangas","english":"I left Batangas","example":"Apo, noong 1978, umalis ako sa Batangas para magtrabaho bilang construction worker sa Saudi.","exampleTranslation":"My grandchild, in 1978 I left Batangas to work as a construction worker in Saudi."},{"tagalog":"para magtrabaho bilang construction worker sa Saudi","english":"to work as a construction worker in Saudi","example":"Apo, noong 1978, umalis ako sa Batangas para magtrabaho bilang construction worker sa Saudi.","exampleTranslation":"My grandchild, in 1978 I left Batangas to work as a construction worker in Saudi."},{"tagalog":"Iyak nang iyak ang lola mo sa airport","english":"your grandma kept crying at the airport","example":"Iyak nang iyak ang lola mo sa airport, at ang tatay mo, apat na taon pa lang noon.","exampleTranslation":"Your grandmother cried and cried at the airport, and your father was only four back then."},{"tagalog":"at ang tatay mo","english":"and your father","example":"Iyak nang iyak ang lola mo sa airport, at ang tatay mo, apat na taon pa lang noon.","exampleTranslation":"Your grandmother cried and cried at the airport, and your father was only four back then."},{"tagalog":"apat na taon pa lang noon","english":"was only four years old then","example":"Iyak nang iyak ang lola mo sa airport, at ang tatay mo, apat na taon pa lang noon.","exampleTranslation":"Your grandmother cried and cried at the airport, and your father was only four back then."},{"tagalog":"Mahirap ang buhay doon","english":"life there was hard","example":"Mahirap ang buhay doon. Sobrang init, at mga sulat lang ng lola mo ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","exampleTranslation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up."},{"tagalog":"Sobrang init","english":"it was extremely hot","example":"Mahirap ang buhay doon. Sobrang init, at mga sulat lang ng lola mo ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","exampleTranslation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up."},{"tagalog":"at mga sulat lang ng lola mo","english":"and only your grandma''s letters","example":"Mahirap ang buhay doon. Sobrang init, at mga sulat lang ng lola mo ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","exampleTranslation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up."},{"tagalog":"ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko","english":"were what kept my courage up","example":"Mahirap ang buhay doon. Sobrang init, at mga sulat lang ng lola mo ang nagpapalakas ng loob ko.","exampleTranslation":"Life there was hard. It was extremely hot, and only your grandma''s letters kept my spirits up."}]}'::jsonb, '4ce4adb8e14b0ac4db40bc6c46a998b1a4928ae81259791392bb0b38cbe8ac8a', '{"contract":"kumusta_lesson_v3","structured_output":true,"local_validation":true,"ordered_chunks":true,"vocabulary_grounded":true,"vocabulary_examples_grounded":true,"hear_respond_rounds":[2,4],"authored_curriculum":true,"native_speaker_review":false}'::jsonb
