    '{"title":"The best-friend toast at a Filipino wedding","scenarioKey":"roadmap_advanced_10_lifes_big_moments","scenario":"Give the best-friend speech at your friend''s wedding reception.","minutes":5,"difficulty":3.5,"rounds":[{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_10_lifes_big_moments","situation":"At the reception, the host hands you the microphone. Two hundred guests, including all the titas, turn to you.","tagalog":"Magandang gabi po sa inyong lahat! Ako po ang best friend ni Carlo mula pa noong high school.","translation":"Good evening, everyone! I''m Carlo''s best friend, ever since high school.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Magandang gabi po sa inyong lahat!","english":"good evening, everyone!","note":"Po to the whole room, because elders are listening."},{"tagalog":"Ako po ang best friend ni Carlo","english":"I''m Carlo''s best friend","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"mula pa noong high school.","english":"ever since high school","note":"Mula pa noong = ''ever since back in''."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Magandang","english":"good, beautiful (+ linker)"},{"token":"gabi","english":"evening, night"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"inyong","english":"your (+ linker, plural)"},{"token":"lahat!","english":"all, everyone, everything"},{"token":"Ako","english":"I"},{"token":"po","english":"(respect marker)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"best friend","english":"best friend"},{"token":"ni","english":"of / by (name marker)"},{"token":"Carlo","english":"Carlo"},{"token":"mula","english":"since, from"},{"token":"pa","english":"still / yet / more"},{"token":"noong","english":"back in, when (past)"},{"token":"high school.","english":"high school"}],"speakingPrompt":"Greet the whole room respectfully and introduce yourself as the groom''s best friend."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_10_lifes_big_moments","situation":"Time for the funny story everyone expects: the groom''s nerves when he first met the bride.","tagalog":"Noong una niyang makita si Anna, tatlong araw siyang hindi makatulog kakaisip kung paano siya lalapit.","translation":"When he first saw Anna, he couldn''t sleep for three days from thinking about how to approach her.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Noong una niyang makita si Anna,","english":"when he first saw Anna","note":"Noong una + verb = ''when ... for the first time''."},{"tagalog":"tatlong araw siyang hindi makatulog","english":"he couldn''t sleep for three days","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"kakaisip kung paano siya lalapit.","english":"from thinking about how to approach her","note":"Kaka- + root = ''from all that ...ing'' (colloquial)."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Noong","english":"back in, when (past)"},{"token":"una","english":"first"},{"token":"niyang","english":"his, her (+ linker)"},{"token":"makita","english":"see"},{"token":"si","english":"(name marker)"},{"token":"Anna,","english":"Anna"},{"token":"tatlong","english":"three (+ linker)"},{"token":"araw","english":"days"},{"token":"siyang","english":"he, she (+ linker)"},{"token":"hindi","english":"not"},{"token":"makatulog","english":"able to sleep"},{"token":"kakaisip","english":"from thinking so much"},{"token":"kung","english":"if / how / where"},{"token":"paano","english":"how"},{"token":"siya","english":"he, she"},{"token":"lalapit.","english":"will approach (future)"}],"speakingPrompt":"Tell the story of how sleepless he was over how to approach Anna."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_10_lifes_big_moments","situation":"The guests are laughing. Now turn to the bride and get sincere.","tagalog":"Pero Anna, ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko.","translation":"But Anna, you''re the reason my friend became a better person.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Pero Anna,","english":"but Anna","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit","english":"you''re the reason why","note":"Keep this chunk together in the middle of the sentence."},{"tagalog":"naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko.","english":"my friend became a better person","note":"Naging = became."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Pero","english":"but"},{"token":"Anna,","english":"Anna"},{"token":"ikaw","english":"you (emphatic)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"dahilan","english":"reason"},{"token":"kung","english":"if / how / where"},{"token":"bakit","english":"why"},{"token":"naging","english":"became (completed)"},{"token":"mas","english":"more"},{"token":"mabuting","english":"good (+ linker)"},{"token":"tao","english":"person"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"kaibigan","english":"friend"},{"token":"ko.","english":"I / my"}],"speakingPrompt":"Speak directly to the bride and tell her how she changed your friend.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Pero Anna, ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko.","promptTranslation":"But Anna, you''re the reason my friend became a better person.","options":[{"englishTranslation":"To you both, I hope you always remember there''s no perfect marriage, but there''s love you choose every day."},{"englishTranslation":"But Anna, you''re the reason my friend became a better person."},{"englishTranslation":"So let''s raise our glasses. To Carlo and Anna, long live the newlyweds!"}],"correctOptionIndex":1}},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_10_lifes_big_moments","situation":"Face both newlyweds and share one piece of advice about marriage.","tagalog":"Sa inyong dalawa, sana lagi ninyong tandaan na walang perpektong pagsasama, pero may pagmamahal na pinipili araw-araw.","translation":"To you both, I hope you always remember there''s no perfect marriage, but there''s love you choose every day.","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Sa inyong dalawa,","english":"to the two of you","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"sana lagi ninyong tandaan","english":"I hope you''ll always remember","note":"Sana = ''I hope''; ninyo here is the plural ''you'': both of them."},{"tagalog":"na walang perpektong pagsasama,","english":"that there''s no perfect marriage","note":"Pagsasama = a couple''s life together."},{"tagalog":"pero may pagmamahal na pinipili araw-araw.","english":"but there''s love you choose every day","note":"Use this ending to complete the spoken thought naturally."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Sa","english":"in, at, to, on"},{"token":"inyong","english":"your (+ linker, plural)"},{"token":"dalawa,","english":"two"},{"token":"sana","english":"I hope"},{"token":"lagi","english":"always"},{"token":"ninyong","english":"you (+ linker, plural)"},{"token":"tandaan","english":"remember"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"walang","english":"there''s no (+ linker)"},{"token":"perpektong","english":"perfect (+ linker)"},{"token":"pagsasama,","english":"life together, marriage"},{"token":"pero","english":"but"},{"token":"may","english":"there is / have"},{"token":"pagmamahal","english":"love"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"pinipili","english":"chosen (ongoing)"},{"token":"araw-araw.","english":"every day"}],"speakingPrompt":"Wish the couple well with advice about choosing love every day."},{"topicKey":"roadmap_advanced_10_lifes_big_moments","situation":"Raise your glass and lead the whole room in the toast.","tagalog":"Kaya itaas na natin ang ating mga baso. Para kina Carlo at Anna, mabuhay ang bagong kasal!","translation":"So let''s raise our glasses. To Carlo and Anna, long live the newlyweds!","chunks":[{"tagalog":"Kaya itaas na natin ang ating mga baso.","english":"so let''s raise our glasses","note":"Start the thought with this reusable chunk."},{"tagalog":"Para kina Carlo at Anna,","english":"to Carlo and Anna","note":"Kina is the plural of kay, for two or more names."},{"tagalog":"mabuhay ang bagong kasal!","english":"long live the newlyweds!","note":"Mabuhay! is the classic toast; the guests cheer it back."}],"wordGlosses":[{"token":"Kaya","english":"so, that''s why"},{"token":"itaas","english":"raise"},{"token":"na","english":"already / now / that (linker)"},{"token":"natin","english":"our / let''s (including you)"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"ating","english":"our (including you)"},{"token":"mga","english":"(plural marker) / about"},{"token":"baso.","english":"glasses"},{"token":"Para","english":"for / so that"},{"token":"kina","english":"to (two or more people)"},{"token":"Carlo","english":"Carlo"},{"token":"at","english":"and"},{"token":"Anna,","english":"Anna"},{"token":"mabuhay","english":"long live, cheers"},{"token":"ang","english":"the (topic marker)"},{"token":"bagong kasal!","english":"newlyweds"}],"speakingPrompt":"Invite everyone to raise their glasses and toast the couple.","responseExercise":{"promptTagalog":"Kaya itaas na natin ang ating mga baso. Para kina Carlo at Anna, mabuhay ang bagong kasal!","promptTranslation":"So let''s raise our glasses. To Carlo and Anna, long live the newlyweds!","options":[{"englishTranslation":"Good evening, everyone! I''m Carlo''s best friend, ever since high school."},{"englishTranslation":"So let''s raise our glasses. To Carlo and Anna, long live the newlyweds!"},{"englishTranslation":"When he first saw Anna, he couldn''t sleep for three days from thinking about how to approach her."}],"correctOptionIndex":1}}],"vocabulary":[{"tagalog":"Magandang gabi po sa inyong lahat","english":"good evening, everyone!","example":"Magandang gabi po sa inyong lahat! Ako po ang best friend ni Carlo mula pa noong high school.","exampleTranslation":"Good evening, everyone! I''m Carlo''s best friend, ever since high school."},{"tagalog":"Ako po ang best friend ni Carlo","english":"I''m Carlo''s best friend","example":"Magandang gabi po sa inyong lahat! Ako po ang best friend ni Carlo mula pa noong high school.","exampleTranslation":"Good evening, everyone! I''m Carlo''s best friend, ever since high school."},{"tagalog":"mula pa noong high school","english":"ever since high school","example":"Magandang gabi po sa inyong lahat! Ako po ang best friend ni Carlo mula pa noong high school.","exampleTranslation":"Good evening, everyone! I''m Carlo''s best friend, ever since high school."},{"tagalog":"Noong una niyang makita si Anna","english":"when he first saw Anna","example":"Noong una niyang makita si Anna, tatlong araw siyang hindi makatulog kakaisip kung paano siya lalapit.","exampleTranslation":"When he first saw Anna, he couldn''t sleep for three days from thinking about how to approach her."},{"tagalog":"tatlong araw siyang hindi makatulog","english":"he couldn''t sleep for three days","example":"Noong una niyang makita si Anna, tatlong araw siyang hindi makatulog kakaisip kung paano siya lalapit.","exampleTranslation":"When he first saw Anna, he couldn''t sleep for three days from thinking about how to approach her."},{"tagalog":"kakaisip kung paano siya lalapit","english":"from thinking about how to approach her","example":"Noong una niyang makita si Anna, tatlong araw siyang hindi makatulog kakaisip kung paano siya lalapit.","exampleTranslation":"When he first saw Anna, he couldn''t sleep for three days from thinking about how to approach her."},{"tagalog":"Pero Anna","english":"but Anna","example":"Pero Anna, ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko.","exampleTranslation":"But Anna, you''re the reason my friend became a better person."},{"tagalog":"ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit","english":"you''re the reason why","example":"Pero Anna, ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko.","exampleTranslation":"But Anna, you''re the reason my friend became a better person."},{"tagalog":"naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko","english":"my friend became a better person","example":"Pero Anna, ikaw ang dahilan kung bakit naging mas mabuting tao ang kaibigan ko.","exampleTranslation":"But Anna, you''re the reason my friend became a better person."},{"tagalog":"Sa inyong dalawa","english":"to the two of you","example":"Sa inyong dalawa, sana lagi ninyong tandaan na walang perpektong pagsasama, pero may pagmamahal na pinipili araw-araw.","exampleTranslation":"To you both, I hope you always remember there''s no perfect marriage, but there''s love you choose every day."}]}'::jsonb, '1482dd161bc397dac998b328e9bfef3e5bc97983e283ad46c12aba07741f0699', '{"contract":"kumusta_lesson_v3","structured_output":true,"local_validation":true,"ordered_chunks":true,"vocabulary_grounded":true,"vocabulary_examples_grounded":true,"hear_respond_rounds":[2,4],"authored_curriculum":true,"native_speaker_review":false}'::jsonb
